To ensure this runs smoothly in your Dublin, California environment, make sure your .env file is populated with the following keys:

POLYGON_API_KEY: For real-time SIP feed access.

OPENAI_API_KEY: For the Sentiment Parser.

TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID / AUTH_TOKEN: For the Priority 1 SMS alerts.

USER_PHONE_NUMBER: Your personal mobile number to receive alerts.
